## What makes this better than PowerPoint

| Feature | PowerPoint | Figma prototype |
|---|---|---|
| Non-linear navigation | No | Yes |
| Zoomable figures | No | Yes |
| Shareable via browser link | No | Yes |
| Real-time collaboration | Limited | Yes |
| Works on any device | Requires software | Any browser |
| Free | No (UVic license) | Yes |
| Looks identical on every screen | No (font substitution) | Yes |

